DESCRIPTION:Date: Saturday\, October 31\, 2026\n\nTime: Doors 6 PM | Show
  7:30 PM\n\nTickets: $10 | Free for Coyote Sonoma Club Members\n\nSince 1
 992\, The Remedies have been casting their spell over Sonoma\, Marin\, and
  Napa with a potent potion of Classic Rock\, Blues\, and R&B. Founded by S
 teve Pabros and Clark Mason\, this Sonoma-based high-energy dance band has
  been raising spirits and keeping dance floors alive for decades.\n\nOn th
 is haunted night\, The Remedies will bring the same electrifying energy an
 d timeless hits that have delighted thousands of fans--only with a Hallowe
 en twist. Expect a thrilling set that will make you move\, groove\, and ma
 ybe even howl at the moon. Don your costumes\, grab your crew\, and let Th
 e Remedies be your cure for a frighteningly fun night of music and dancing
 !
LOCATION:Coyote Sonoma
URL:https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/the-remedies-halloween-party-1031-p261.a
 spx
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
