SUMMARY:Flynn Creek Circus - The Cricket and the Wren
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T170000
UID:261019YBzjwbs92E6snUKQ8qbRnQ
DESCRIPTION:Flynn Creek Circus Presents ‘The Cricket & the Wren’: a hi
 ghly original\, all-human circus that enchants through breathtaking acroba
 tics and athletically stunning skill. Sponsored by the good folks at Sebas
 topol Grange.\n\n**Sebastopol\, CA— Oct 29 - Nov 1**– This 2026 season
 \, Flynn Creek Circus invites audiences to ‘*The Cricket & the Wren’* 
 — memorable family fun and Artful athleticism under the circus big top.\
 n\nA merchant’s daughter sets out to find the castle where the horizon m
 eets the sea. In order to  break the spell of the Frog Prince\, she must 
 brave a harrowing journey filled with wonder.\n\nAlong the adventure\, she
  encounters Jack and the Beanstalk’s sassy cow\, an out of pocket Pirate
  and the secret sacrifice of the cricket and the wren. \n\nFeaturing aeri
 alists\, jugglers\, knife throwers\, and laugh out loud comedy\, this circ
 us blends classic storybook archetypes with imaginative new heroes. **The 
 Cricket and the Wren** will surprise\, dazzle and delight all ages. \n\nI
 n addition to the family friendly showings\,  and the interactive childre
 n's camp program held under the circus big top\,  Flynn Creek Circus also
  presents the wildly popular 'Adults Only Show' boasting outrageous acts\,
  dark comedy\, and an infamous party atmosphere. Check the website for sel
 ect adults only showtimes as well as special discount nights.\n\nSpectator
 s for all showings are invited to the tent to experience the magic up to 3
 0 minutes before each show. The event will offer beer\, wine\, and light c
 oncession for purchase and include a 15 minute intermission during the two
  hour show.\n\n**Showtimes:**\n\nThursday\, Oct 29\n\n7:00 PM Show (Family
  Special\, all reservations %10 off)\n\nFriday\, Oct 30\n\n7 PM Show (Adul
 ts Only 21+)\n\nSaturday\, Oct 31\n\n3:00 PM Show – (Halloween extravaga
 nza)\n\n8:00 PM Show (Adults Only 21+)\n\nSunday\, Nov 1\n\n1:00 PM Show (
 Day of the Dead special $10 off table reservations)\n\n5:00 PM Show
LOCATION:SEBASTOPOL GRANGE 
URL:https://flynncreekcircus.com/tickets-page-2026/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
