DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T130000
UID:261027A1yTsvnlO0S_yjnH0AuJFQ
DESCRIPTION:Join us Saturdays at Inner Light Crystals for Rock Talk - a fr
 ee weekly exploration of rocks\, minerals\, crystals\, geology\, and the f
 ascinating things the Earth creates.\n\nEach week we explore something a l
 ittle different\, from mineral families and formations to unusual specimen
 s\, geological processes\, and the details that make rocks and minerals so
  interesting.\n\nCome curious. Bring your questions. Geek out with us.\n\n
 Rock Talk begins at 12 PM and typically runs approximately 30–60 minutes
 .\n\nFREE to attend.\n\nInner Light Crystals\n\n4936 Sonoma Hwy\n\nSanta R
 osa\, CA\n\nSaturdays at Noon
LOCATION:Inner Light Crystals
URL:http://www.innerlightcrystalshop.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
