DESCRIPTION:Directed by Tony SalamoneA powerful and compassionate drama ab
 out love\, loss\, and living fully\n\nFriday &amp\; Saturday\, October 23 
 &amp\; 24 at 7 p.m.\, Sunday October 25 at 2 p.m.. Friday &amp\; Saturday\
 , October 30 &amp\; 31 at 7 p.m.\, Sunday\, November 1 at 2 p.m.\n\nWritte
 n by Michael Cristofer\n\nGeneral Admission Tickets are $20\, \\+$5 day of
 \, $100 Sponsor Tickets with Select Seating available online only
URL:https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/gat-shadowbox?aff=cityspar
 k
