SUMMARY:Mary Collins School at Cherry Valley Presents Beetlejuice JR
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T140000
UID:261026RQDvzjmlAUO5i2py3_OiUA
DESCRIPTION:Something strange and unusual is coming to Mary Collins at Che
 rry Valley School! The school's Theater Arts Program \\(TAP\\) presents Be
 etlejuice JR.\, running October 30–November 8\, 2026\, featuring two cas
 ts of talented young performers and a student technical crew bringing the 
 beloved Broadway musical to life.\n\nUnder the leadership of Darby Ciampi\
 , Lindsey Nettleton\, and an experienced creative team\, TAP delivers an a
 mbitious theatrical experience that goes far beyond the stage. Students ar
 e involved in every aspect of production\, from acting\, singing\, and cho
 reography to lighting\, sound\, set construction\, costumes\, and props. W
 ith professional mentorship\, students gain hands-on experience in the ful
 l theatrical process\, developing creativity\, confidence\, and collaborat
 ion along the way.
LOCATION:Mary Collins School at Cherry Vallet
URL:https://my.cheddarup.com/c/mccv-beetlejuice-jr/items
