BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Open Mic for musicians\, poets\, and comics
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261103T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261103T210000
UID:251026957uDunJv0GRROf05cwhgA
DESCRIPTION:Randy has been a popular Open Mic host in Calistoga for 30 yea
 rs\, encouraging all who come and perform. He welcomes all types of musici
 ans\, vocalists\, poets\, and comics\, and makes sure everyone gets a turn
