UID:261023csKb8_6KQEqlP2QQb3ZSBQ
DESCRIPTION:Test your knowledge and have fun learning about native plants!
  Join the Laguna de Santa Rosa Foundation\, California Native Plant Societ
 y – Milo Baker Chapter\, and Sonoma County Ag + Open Space for this inte
 ractive trivia event that has something for everyone. Join rounds of frien
 dly competition\, test your knowledge\, and discover fascinating facts abo
 ut the native plants that support local wildlife and resilient landscapes.
  You can come solo or bring a team and enjoy the chance to connect with fe
 llow plant enthusiasts! Refreshments and snacks provided. There is no char
 ge for this event. It is made possible by the taxpayers of Sonoma County\,
  who fund the work of Ag + Open Space through a quarter-cent sales tax.
