 a and beyond perform at Barrel Proof Lounge. Stick around after for late-n
 ight karaoke!\n\nFresh lineup of funny each Friday.\n\nThis Week: Host: Jo
 sh Argyle Dashiell Renaud Nick Meier\n\nHeadliner: Jon Gabrielli\n\nJon Ga
 brielli is one of the top rising comedians in California. Cementing himsel
 f as a Norcal favorite\, he performs regularly at major comedy clubs\, the
 aters\, colleges\, breweries\, wineries\, casinos\, and more all over the 
 country. Winner of over a dozen comedy competitions\, Jon opens for comedi
 ans like TJ Miller\, Matt McCusker Troy Bond\, Pablo Francisco\, and many 
 more. Jon was in a featured film at the Sundance Film Festival.\n\nHis com
 edy is interactive and creative\, he takes audiences on journeys through h
 is mischievous outlook on the events in his life. You can catch him updati
 ng constantly online @jongabcomedy 21+ Doors - 7p / Show - 8p $15adv / $20
 door\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good time
 s ahead.
