BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Amazing Bubble Man
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T140000
UID:261005Ze9lEwRHKU-V-yfj96Ke1A
DESCRIPTION:Price: Adults $34 \\(Marin Center Fees Included\\) 17 and unde
 r $23 \\(Marin Center Fees Included\\) Family of 4 $100 \\(Marin Center Fe
 es included. Price automatically adjusts at check out when 4 seats are add
 ed to the cart.\\)\n\nTicket Info: https://tickets.marincenter.org/eventpe
 rformances.asp?evt=384\n\nLouis Pearl has been thrilling audiences around 
 the world for over 30 years with the art\, magic\, science and fun of bubb
 les. He is a favorite at the Edinburgh Fringe Festival\, where he has enjo
 yed twelve years of sell-out success.\n\nLouis explores the breath-taking 
 dynamics of bubbles\, combining comedy and artistry with audience particip
 ation and enough spellbinding bubble tricks to keep everyone mesmerized. F
 rom square bubbles\, bubbles inside bubbles\, fog -filled bubbles\, giant 
 bubbles\, bubble volcanoes\, tornados and trampo lines to people inside bu
 bbles\, the Amazing Bubble Man conjures shrieks of laughter and gasps of a
 mazement from all ages.\n\n"This show captivated its young audience and th
 e adults loved it as well. Highly recommended." -British Theater Guide.< b
 r\\>\n\n"The show is one giant\, joyous caper"-The W ee Review\n\n"Better 
 Than Cirque du Soleil" -Co rbin Doughy\, 11 audience member.\n\n"Greatest 
 Bubble Show on Earth." - San Francisco Chronicle
LOCATION:Showcase Theatre
URL:https://www.marincounty.gov/county-marin-calendar
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cuban Salsa Intermediate 4-Week Class
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T140000
UID:2610033gH_JisD80-MgcdedJ1PmQ
DESCRIPTION:November 7- November 28\n\n1:00 pm – 2:00 pm\n\nTake your da
 ncing to the next level in this focused\, high-energy intensive! Designed 
 for dancers who already know the fundamentals.\n\nCuban salsa Intermediate
  class will move beyond basic steps to focus on complex partner work patte
 rns\, advanced body styling\, dynamic musicality\, and the authentic flow 
 of Cuban Casino.\n\n• 4-week course\, Saturdays\n\n• Date: November 7-
  November 28 (4-week)\n\n• Time: 1:00 pm – 2:00 Pm\n\n• Location: 41
 40 Redwood Highway #8\, San Rafael\, CA\n\n• Registration Note: This cla
 ss requires a minimum of 8 registrations to run. Please register early so 
 we can secure the session! Please no walk-ins\n\nPrerequisites\n\n• To e
 nsure a fluid\, fast-paced learning environment\, this is an Intermediate 
 level\n\nRequirement: You must have completed a Beginner Cuban Salsa cours
 e or have a solid grasp of beginner fundamentals (including basic footwork
 \, timing\, standard left/right turns\, and fundamental partner connection
 ).\n\nWhat We Will Cover\n\n• Advanced Partnerwork: Intricate Cuban Casi
 no patterns\, seamless transitions\, and directional changes.\n\n• Styli
 ng & Body Movement: Incorporating authentic Cuban body isolation and natur
 al expression into your dancing.\n\n• Musicality & Connection: Refining 
 lead/follow mechanics to hit musical breaks and accents naturally.\n\n• 
 Intensive Structure: We will kick off with a quick body isolation warm-up 
 and advanced footwork exercises before diving straight into partnerwork te
 chnique and practical\, social-ready combinations.\n\nCome dance with us\,
  elevate your technique\, and experience the energy and flavor of Cuba in 
 a supportive and welcoming environment!\n\nImportant Details\n\n• Arriva
 l: Please arrive 10 minutes before class starts (2:50 PM) to check in. •
  Shoe Policy: No floor-marking shoe soles allowed on the dance floor.\n\n4
 140 Redwood Highway #8\, San Rafael\, CA
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin 
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/cuban-salsa-intermediate/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
