DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T160000
UID:261004S_qzh7Q1uEKS3X6k83GHrg
DESCRIPTION:Set among nine acres in Sonoma Wine Country\, Cornerstone brin
 gs together plants\, landscapes\, art\, architecture\, food\, wine and des
 ign. With new ownership enthusiastic about putting horticulture and garden
 s at the forefront once again\, JARDIN EXTRAVAGANZA celebrates Cornerstone
 's garden legacy - and what comes next. John Greenlee\, principal of The G
 reenlee Meadow Collection and one of the original landscape designers to p
 articipate in the creation of the Cornerstone Gardens more then 20 years a
 go\, has invited fellow plant people - nurseries\, specialty growers\, pla
 nt societies\, botanical gardens\, landscape and garden designers\, hortic
 ultural organizations\, collectors\, and friends of the horticultural comm
 unity - to come together for one extraordinary day at Cornerstone Sonoma f
 or a celebration of all things garden - JARDIN EXTRAVAGANZA. Please join u
 s - shop for plants\, pick up tips from the experts\, be inspired. Bring t
 he children\, we'll have garden-related fun for them.\n\nPLANT SALES\, TAL
 KS AND TOURS\, KID'S ACTIVITIES\n\nTO PLANT A GARDEN IS TO BELIEVE IN THE 
 FUTURE Come for the plants - stay for the day. Enjoy a picnic on the lawn.
  Go home happy.
LOCATION:Cornerstone Sonoma
URL:http://www.cornerstonesonoma.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
