BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jumpstart Your Art
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T160000
UID:260629mn8Yge0KEUe1FN4I9bfU2A
DESCRIPTION:Every person experiences an ebb and flow to the tides of their
  creativity. We will share space together to design\, exchange ideas\, and
  hold ourselves accountable to our unique interests! The first portion of 
 our time together will involve a check-in discussion of ‘what is'\, lead
 ing into ‘what could be'. The talk will be facilitated by Erin Partridge
 \, an art therapist with a long history of supporting people in reengaging
  with creativity. After our initial talk\, we will have some time to indiv
 idually focus on our creative practices in the space of the gallery. Befor
 e we close\, we will share anything that came up in the process. Bring you
 r ideas\, a project\, and an interest in creative community. Please be min
 dful of what you choose to show up with-something quiet\, easy to clean up
 \, and non-disruptive to your fellow creatives. Not sure where to begin? S
 ome basic materials are available\, thanks to a donation from  Blick Art M
 aterials . Open for all ages-youth under 12 with an adult chaperone please
 ! Mondays\, 1-4 PM Facilitator: Erin Partridge
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/jumpstart-your-art/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:BellyDancing with Carem
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261109T190000
UID:261012SFCHMdW0k0Onn2TDjTVqnQ
DESCRIPTION:Bellydancing for Beginners \n\nDiscover the beauty of Raqs Sh
 arqi \\(bellydance\\). This beginner-friendly class introduces you to fou
 ndational bellydance technique\, including hip movements\, isolations\, un
 dulations\, traveling steps\, combinations and musicality. You’ll develo
 p coordination\, body awareness\, strength\, and confidence while learning
  to move with greater ease and expression.\n\nNo previous dance experience
  is required. All bodies and experience levels are welcome.\n\nCome move t
 o the music\, connect with your body\, and discover the joy of bellydancin
 g\n\nCAREM LOVE\n\nCarem Love is a wellness advocate\, professional dancer
 \, and certified yoga instructor with a Bachelor’s degree in Dance. She 
 has extensive training in Bellydance\, a deep passion for Latin dance\, an
 d is certified in Hatha\, Vinyasa\, and Children’s Yoga.\n\nBelly dance 
 has profoundly supported her health\, well-being\, and dance career\, insp
 iring her to help others experience the same body-mind benefits. In her cl
 asses\, students learn to connect more deeply with themselves.\n\nDATE: Mo
 nday\n\nTIME: 6:00 PM\n\nWHERE: Salsa Dance Marin\, 4140 Redwood Hwy 8\, S
 an Rafael
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/belly-dancing-with-carem/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maple Magic & Winter Wonder
