BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bongs + Books Silent Book Club at The Lounge at Mercy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T200000
UID:261014fz9f8FZ4pE21ssBLEC3nGA
DESCRIPTION:Bongs + Books is our monthly silent book club where we light u
 p & swap small talk for story time. No assigned books\, no deadlines\, no 
 discussions or small talk — just a shared space to unwind\, light up\, a
 nd get lost in a good read.\n\nBring whatever you’re currently reading (
 or listening - we have coloring books and puzzles for our audiobook lovers
 !)\, grab something to smoke\, and settle in for a cozy\, low-pressure nig
 ht of uninterrupted reading alongside fellow book lovers.\n\nCome solo or 
 with friends and enjoy comfy vibes\, good weed\, and a room full of people
  happily minding their own business.\n\nHow it works:\n\n5-6pm: Arrive\, g
 et settled\, and kick things off with a short welcome sesh.\n\n6-7pm: head
 s-down reading time\, lo-fi music\, and chill energy.\n\n7-8pm: wrap up ch
