BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Singles Bingo + Switch - Bingo with a Touch of Speed Dating ages 3
 0-49
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T184500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T213000
UID:261029zjukHHOBxkqpEZ_wr_UQkg
DESCRIPTION:Singles Bingo \\+ Switch | Bingo with a Touch of Speed Dating\
 n\nSick of Dating Apps?\n\nJoin Catch Singles and North Bay Bingo for a fu
 n\, interactive evening at Trailhouse Café in Santa Rosa. We’re putting
  a fresh spin on traditional speed dating by combining bingo\, rotating se
 ats\, and plenty of opportunities to connect.\n\nAs bingo rounds end\, par
 ticipants switch seats\, giving everyone a chance to meet new people natur
 ally. No awkward interviews or forced conversations — just good company\
 , a little friendly competition\, and the possibility of meeting someone s
 pecial.\n\nAfter bingo\, stick around for a relaxed social mixer to contin
 ue conversations and make new connections!\n\nThursday\, November 19 | 7:0
 0–9:30 PM \\(check in 6:45\\) Trailhouse Café | Santa Rosa Singles ages
  30–49 $40 per person | Includes one beverage\n\nLimited spots available
 . Advance registration required.\n\nHosted by Catch Singles — Bringing l
 ocal singles together\, one event at a time.
LOCATION:Trailhouse
URL:https://c33ab2fd-1a51-41cb-998d-23ec1d275308.paylinks.godaddy.com/e4a1
 bf9d-038f-4da5-a90a-6ff
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Turkey 101 with Chef Charlie Palmer
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T180000
UID:261027wCPECtaf6kua9QfQnOZS2Q
DESCRIPTION:Just in time for Thanksgiving\, Chef Charlie Palmer leads a ha
 nds-on master class on the holiday bird at Appellation Healdsburg. Limited
  to ten guests\, the class covers brining for flavor\, breaking down a who
 le turkey\, trussing and roasting it to a caramelized finish\, with every 
 guest working through each step. Winemaker Tom Rochioli pours alongside\, 
 pairing the turkey with the wine he serves at his own Thanksgiving table. 
 Guests leave ready to host the holiday with confidence.
LOCATION:Appellation Healdsburg
URL:https://www.appellationhotels.com/hotels/california-healdsburg/classes
 /turkey-101/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sonoma County Vintners Pour + Explore: Rhône Varietals
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T193000
UID:261024GdHtOV4hkEioexRvx14U4w
DESCRIPTION:From rich\, expressive reds to bright\, aromatic whites\, Sono
 ma County’s Rhône varietals offer a world of flavor and character waiti
 ng to be discovered.\n\nJoin us for Pour \\+ Explore: Rhône Varietals hos
 ted at Longboard Vineyards \\(5 Fitch Street\, Healdsburg\\) on Thursday N
 ovember 19th\, an evening celebrating the diversity\, versatility and dist
 inctive expressions of these beloved grape varieties.\n\nParticipating win
 eries include Adobe Road Winery\, Anaba Wines\, Bricoleur Vineyards\, Clin
 e Family Cellars\, Dutcher Crossing\, Kendric Vineyards\, Lasseter Family 
 Wines\, Limerick Lane Cellars\, Longboard Vineyards\, Martinelli Winery\, 
 Muscardinni Cellars\, Peay Vineyards\, Pride Mountain Vineyards\, Ram’s 
 Gate\, Ridge \\+MORE!\n\nFood available for purchase at event! SoCo Paella
  brings over 15 years of Spanish cooking experience to Pour & Explore as t
 he event’s exclusive food vendor. Created to complement the host winery
 ’s Rhône wines\, the signature paella features peppery chicken\, rosema
 ry-infused pork\, and smoky sausage\, all cooked in fragrant saffron chick
 en broth with roasted root vegetables.
LOCATION:Longboard Vineyards
URL:https://www.cellarpass.com/events/sonoma-county-vintners-pour-explore-
 rhone-varietals-12459
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
