 munity and support our local businesses.This year\, we’re thrilled to fe
 ature over 20 wineries and food vendors! Enjoy a leisurely stroll as you r
 elax\, nibble\, and shop—what better way to complete your holiday giftin
 g?A portion of the proceeds benefits **Circuit Rider**\, a local nonprofit
  making a meaningful impact mentoring youth across Sonoma County. It’s a
  great way to give back while being part of something festive and fun.With
  only 450 tickets available for this beloved event\, be sure to secure you
 rs soon!**Ticket Information:**\n\n**General tickets $67:** Includes wris
 tband\, a logo glass\, food and wine tastings\, a map of participating loc
 ations\, and exclusive shopping specials for your Holiday needs.\n\n**Desi
 gnated Driver tickets $25:** Includes a DD wristband\, food tastings\, a
  bottle of water\, a swag bag\, a map of participating locations\, and ex
 clusive shopping specials for your holiday needs. Limited availability.\n\
 n**\\*An email with check-in details will be sent two days prior to the ev
 ent (don’t forget to check your spam folder).** \n\n**Remember to bring 
 your ID when checking in! We can’t wait to celebrate with you! Is your b
 usiness interested in Event Sponsorship?  Contact the Windsor Chamber for
  more information at 707-838-7285 or kristinp@windsorchamber.com.**\n\n**W
 inter Wine Walk 2026 Committee:**\n\n**Laurie Shimizu - Mark Shimizu Desig
 ns**\n\n**Ty Shimizu - Shimizu Media Co. LLC**\n\n**Tracy Laird - Who's C
 ounting?**\n\n**Lisa Ahrens - Mutt Lynch Winery**\n\n**Vladimir Bienvenue 
 - Bienvenue Winery**\n\n**Kristin Piotter - Windsor Chamber of Commerce St
 aff**
