BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SUN ROOM
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T234500
UID:2610066lNOhXCN-0K4ZRbtZ5vWjg
DESCRIPTION:proudly presents:  An Evening With SUN ROOM at  Friday\, Novem
 ber 20thDoors at 8:00 • Show at 9:00General Admission: $25 Advance / $30
  at the DoorAll Ages Born and raised in San Diego's surf-rock scene\, the 
 indie rock group Sun Room has built their world around loud guitars\, rest
 less energy\, and the feeling of being young and figuring it out as you go
 . What started with house shows getting shut down for playing too loudly h
 as grown into a band with a global audience\, over 500K followersacross so
 cial media\, over 1 million monthly listeners on Spotify and a growing his
 tory of sold-out shows and international touring. Formed in 2021\, Sun Roo
 m quickly broke out with two songs featured on Netflix's Outer Banks\, fol
 lowed by tours with Louis Tomlinson\, Inhaler\, Dayglow\, and Flipturn\, a
 s well as multiple North American headline runs. Their 2023 EP At Least I 
 Tried established their garage-rock foundation\, while 2025's Ritual of Ch
 aos expanded their sound into blues-rock\, shoegaze\, and post-punk. Now\,
  Sun Room are entering their biggest chapter yet with their debut album on
  the horizon\, with more info to be announced soon.  You can check out the
  recently released music video for their newest single “Annie” HERE - 
 which is the fastest single to 1 million streams in Sun Room's career. As 
 Sun Room begins to roll out their highlyanticipated debut album\, they're 
 embracing their Southern California roots while continuing to evolve the s
 ound and energy that first put them on the map.
URL:https://www.my805tix.com/e/sunroom/tickets
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
