BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pi Jacobs\, Ben Musser & Walker Young at The Lost Church Santa Ros
 a
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T223000
UID:261028buIBThb1WkCR2mlbof4Tkg
DESCRIPTION:Pi Jacobs draws inspiration from her unconventional upbringing
  in Northern California\, where she was raised by “radical hippies\, boh
 emians and nerds”.   She is signed to LA’s Blackbird Record Label\, a
 nd her 2024 album\, “Soldier On”\, was on the Americana Music Associat
 ion Chart top 50 upon release in 2024\, and stayed there for over 16 weeks
 .  \n\nPi has released two new topical singles in 2026. Mrs. Nobody\, a p
 owerful ballad with references to to the SAVES act\, limiting married wome
 n’s right to vote\, and Nogales\, a song chronicling racial profiling at
  the Mexican-American  border\, via a personal experience. “I was havin
 g trouble writing\, until I started writing about it head on”. The singe
 r-songwriter states\, with regards to the political nature of her new musi
 c.  She is currently recording her next album\, which will include Nogale
 s\, Mrs. Nobody\, and other songs that reflect on the current experience o
 f living in the US.  Nogales has been receiving airplay on Sirius XM\, Th
 e Village\, as of July 2026\n\nhttps://PiJacobs.com  https://Facebook.com
 /PiJacobsMusic      https://Instagram.com/PiJacobs    https://www.you
 tube.com/PiJacobsMusic\n\nBen Musser & Walker Young make up a roots power-
 duo from Jackson Hole\, Wyoming who perform vocally driven soul and countr
 y music. Young \\(of Truth & Salvage Co.\\) performs accordion\, keyboards
  and vocals and Musser \\(formerly Benyaro\\) performs guitars\, drums\, a
 nd vocals. The duo is promoting Musser’s new solo album ‘Sentimental F
 ever’ \\(Blackbird Record Label\\) that's been featured on CMT\, NPR\, E
 ARMILK\, Visual Atelier 8\, and receiving AAA radio play across the countr
 y. Musser and Young are currently recording their premiere EP at Musser's 
 studio in Jackson Hole. Passionate performances\, boot-stomping joy\, and 
 seasoned vocals that move both themselves and others to sing and feel the 
 emotion\, explain the Ben Musser & Walker Young live music performance exp
 erience. https://www.instagram.com/benmussermusichttps://www.facebook.com
 /benmussermusicahttps://www.tiktok.com/@benmussermusic
LOCATION:The Lost Church
URL:https://thelostchurch.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/instances/a0FUh
 00000DV2CXMA1
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
