BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Booked & Bottled: Build a Blind Date with a Book at Coursey Graves
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T170000
UID:261013Ui8DowHflEGZ5YRZ2RvBIw
DESCRIPTION:Taste your way to a book you’ve never read: Coursey Graves p
 ours a flight of wines\, each one paired to a genre\, and the pour you lov
 e points you toward your blind date with a book.\n\nChardonnay points towa
 rd historical fiction\, Sonoma Coast Pinot Noir toward romantasy\, Syrah t
 oward contemporary fiction\, ‘22 Napa Cabernet toward thriller (exact pa
 irings may shift slightly by the day of the event). The books are a curate
 d selection of new releases across all of those genres\, so you’ll get a
  few clues along the way\, enough to feel confident you’re walking away 
 with something you’ll genuinely like.\n\nFollow your favorite pour to it
 s genre\, then build your blind date: choose from book-themed baubles (boo
 kmarks\, stickers\, tea\, and more) to tuck inside\, wrap it all up yourse
 lf\, and add a pairing card explaining why that book and that wine belong 
 together. The book itself stays a mystery until you’re home and ready to
  unwrap it.\n\nYour ticket includes a full glass of wine plus your flight 
 of pours\, food from Coursey Graves\, your wrapped blind-date book and bau
 bles to take home\, fun bookish games\, and a spot at the book swap. Add-o
 n blind dates are available if you want to build a second one! One bookish
  blind date is good\, but it also makes a great holiday gift for someone e
 lse on your list.\n\nCoursey Graves’ standard tasting runs $75. For $60\
 , this ticket gets you wine\, food\, access to a great community of reader
 s\, a book matched to your favorite pour\, and an afternoon built around a
 ll four.\n\n$60 general admission\, $45 for Novel Pairings Book Club or Co
 ursey Graves Wine Club members. Only 50 tickets available. Come solo\, bri
 ng a friend\, or round up your book club\; most people leave having swappe
 d recommendations with someone new. 21+.
LOCATION:Coursey Graves Estate Winery
URL:https://www.novel-pairings.com/bookedbottled
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
