DESCRIPTION:Journey Beyond Sound presents a special Thanksgiving sound bat
 h journey at Sonoma Community Center. Settle in for guided meditation and 
 a live meditative soundscape created by a talented ensemble of musicians p
 laying crystal and Tibetan singing bowls\, symphonic gongs\, chimes\, Nati
 ve flute\, violin\, drums\, and other resonant instruments.\n\nAs Thanksgi
 ving approaches\, take time away from the busyness of the season to relax\
 , reflect\, and connect with gratitude. Open to both newcomers and returni
 ng sound bath guests.\n\nSunday\, November 22\, 2026 | 5:00–6:15 PM Sono
 ma Community Center\, Sonoma
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center - Community Room 110
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/sounds-of-gratitude-thanksg
 iving-sound-bath-journey/
