 h a disability and require an accommodation to participate in a County pro
 gram\, service\, or activity\, requests may be made by calling&n bsp\;415-
 473-4381 \\(Voice\\)\, Dial 711 for CA Relay\, or by submitting a\n\nDisab
 ility Accommodation Request\n\nat least five business days in advance of t
 he event. We will do our best to fulfill requests received with less than 
