 ed on the same day.\n\nLearn from a top-rated\, local CPR training company
  with over 1\,000 5-star reviews! Our classes are fun\, engaging\, and exp
 ertly taught by professional first responders with years of experience.\n\
 nLEARN MORE & ENROLL: https://vivecpr.com/class/heartcode-pals/\n\nQuestio
 ns? Call/text \\(707\\) 612-3277 or https://vivecpr.com/contact
