DESCRIPTION:Every Wednesday is Senior Discount Day at Inner Light Crystals
 .\n\nShoppers age 60 and older receive 10% off their purchase all day.\n\n
 Come explore our lovingly curated collection of crystals\, jewelry\, books
 \, oracle and tarot decks\, plants\, gifts\, ritual tools\, and more.\n\nI
 nner Light Crystals is women-owned and operated\, proudly local\, inclusiv
 e\, and welcoming to all.\n\nWednesdays • 11 AM–6 PM\n\nInner Light Cr
 ystals\n\n4936 Sonoma Hwy\n\nSanta Rosa\, CA
LOCATION:Inner Light Crystals
URL:http://www.innerlightcrystalshop.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
