 he Kenwood Turkey Trot is back for it's 3rd year\, and it's time to lace u
 p your running shoes for this festive community tradition.\n\nStart your h
 oliday with fun\, fitness\, and great community event. Whether you are a d
 edicated runner chasing your best time or just looking for a lighthearted 
 way to kick off Thanksgiving\, this trot is perfect for the whole family. 
 Strollers\, little legs\, and even festive costumes are welcome.\n\nBring 
 your friends\, bring your family\, and make some space for all that pumpki
 n pie!\n\nThis year's winner will be crowned with a Trophy and a Pie!
