  is offered Thursday through Sunday.\n\nMENU:\n\nGATHER\n\n2021 Goldeneye 
 Brut Rosé\n\nRoasted Beet Mosaic\n\nFeta\, Squash\, Chickpeas\, & Walnuts
 \n\n2023 Calera Mt. Harlan Chardonnay\n\nBrown Butter Potato Gnocchi\n\nBr
 ussels Sprouts\, Sous-vide Bacon\, Calvados & Sage\n\n2023 Duckhorn Rector
  Creek Merlot\n\nGRA Z E\n\nHeirloom Floriani Red Flint Corn Polenta\n\nWi
 ld Mushrooms and Aged Gouda Cheese\n\n2022 Paraduxx Rector Creek Cabernet 
 - Zinfandel Blend\n\nSmoked Beef Short Rib\n\nBaby Root Vegetable Gremolat
 a\n\n2023 Duckhorn Patzimaro Cabernet Sauvignon\n\nSAVOR\n\nPear Butter Ca
 ke\n\nGorgonzola Anglaise\, Spiced Pecans\, Caramel\n\nPairing: 2021 Caler
 a Viognier Doux\n\n- Please note this is a 21 and over experience\n\n- Gro
 up size: 2-6 guests﻿﻿\n\n- Duration: Please allow 90-120 minutes for t
 his experience
LOCATION:The Duckhorn Collection
URL:https://www.theduckhorncollection.com/pages/culinary
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Intermediate Salsa with Eric
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T193000
UID:261011L-Cg2GNqVE6Pes0isVjg6g
DESCRIPTION:Ready to learn intermediate steps and technique?\n\nAre you a 
 salsa dancer who has the basics down but is ready to add more? Our Interme
 diate Salsa Class is designed to help you transform your dancing moves.\n\
 nIn this class\, you’ll go beyond the basics to learn intricate footwork
 \, enhance your leading and following skills\, and master the body movemen
 t that will make you shine on the dance floor.\n\nThis class is for anyone
  ready to learn the techniques and intermediate steps needed to take their
  dancing to the next level.\n\nYou’ll learn intermediate dancing techniq
 ues that will help you:\n\n• Express yourself with sharper footwork and 
 styling.\n\n• Master complex turn patterns and combinations.\n\n• Stre
 ngthen your lead and follow for seamless\, connected dancing.\n\n• Adapt
  to different partners and music with ease on the social dance floor.\n\nW
 hat to Expect: Instructor blends a fun\, supportive atmosphere with struct
 ured lessons\, so you’re always challenged but never overwhelmed. Helpin
 g you progress steadily while keeping the joy of salsa front and center.\n
 \nDetails:\n\n• No partner necessary—rotations ensure everyone dances.
 \n\n• Please wear non-marking shoes to protect the floor.\n\n• Arrive 
 10 minutes early to warm up and get settled.\n\n• When: Fridays\, 6:30 P
 M – 7:30 PM\n\nInstructor: Eric Celestino\n\nWhere: 4140 Redwood Highway
  \\#8\, San Rafael\, CA
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/intermediate-salsa-with-eric/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Friday Nights in The Lounge w/ DJ Oso Perez & DJ Doc Boogie
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T010000
UID:260923-VxohZC_pkW0ItHjK2mO2w
DESCRIPTION:Chill out every Friday night with DJ Oso Perez & DJ Doc Boogie
  spinning live vibes in The Lounge!\n\nFRIDAY NIGHTS IN THE LOUNGE DJ Oso 
 Perez & DJ Doc Boogie Hip Hop • Reggaeton • Música Urbana Friday nigh
 ts go late at Barrel Proof Lounge.\n\nEvery Friday at 10 PM\, DJ Oso Perez
  & DJ Doc Boogie take over the lounge with a late-night mix of Hip Hop\, R
 eggaeton and Música Urbana \, keeping the front room moving into the nigh
 t. Oso is back behind the decks at Barrel Proof\, but this time we're swit
 ching things up. The focus is Hip Hop\, Reggaeton and Latin urban sounds 
 — with Oso and Doc Boogie working the room and keeping the party moving 
 all night.\n\nAnd there's more happening under the same roof.\n\nStart you
 r night with Friday Night Comedy in the Main Room\, then at 10 PM Barrel P
 roof splits into two completely different late-night parties:\n\n THE LOU
 NGE — 10 PM DJ Oso Perez & DJ Doc Boogie Hip Hop • Reggaeton • Músi
 ca Urbana Dancing\, drinks and late-night Friday energy.\n\n THE BIG STAG
 E — 10 PM Late Night Karaoke Grab the mic and take over the Barrel Proof
  stage.\n\nMove between the rooms. Dance for a while. Sing something quest
 ionable. Grab another drink. Repeat as necessary.\n\nEVERY FRIDAY NIGHT  
 DJs start at 10 PM  Barrel Proof Lounge 501 Mendocino Ave • Downtown Sa
 nta Rosa  DJ Oso Perez & DJ Doc Boogie  Hip Hop • Reggaeton • Músic
 a Urbana  Late Night Karaoke in the Main Room  21+\n\nCome for comedy. S
 tay for the party.\n\nBarrel Proof Lounge Comedy • Live Music • Karaok
 e • DJs • Events\n\nDowntown Santa Rosa
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/friday-nights-in-the-lounge-w-dj-oso-pere
 z-dj-doc-boogie-tickets-2002100950839?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maple Magic & Winter Wonder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T170000
UID:260824IW_CMmE9yUmAJ7EITnWUXA
DESCRIPTION:As the days grow shorter and cooler\, Sonoma Botanical Garden 
 transforms with the beauty of the changing seasons. From the first signs o
 f autumn in October to the brilliant display of rare Asian maples in Nov
 ember and the quiet beauty of early winter in December\, each visit offer
 s something new to discover. \n\n*Maple Magic* *& Winter Wonder* invites
  visitors to experience this special time of year through nature\, creativ
 ity\, and connection. Throughout the season\, the Garden offers guided wal
 ks\, hands-on workshops\, lectures\, and special experiences inspired by t
 he changing landscape. Wander among vibrant fall foliage\, breathe in the 
 sweet fragrance of katsura trees\, enjoy creative programs\, and experienc
 e the peaceful beauty of the Garden as it transitions into winter.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
