BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Taste of Italy at Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T170000
UID:260430hSiNRtLX4U2SyFRKsdwgMQ
DESCRIPTION:For wine drinkers eager to experience world-class wines made i
 n California from Italian varieties\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
  is a must during any trip to Sonoma County. Located just off the plaza in
  the charming town of Healdsburg near famed restaurants\, boutiques and ga
 lleries\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room is a destination that invit
 es discovery. Founded by the acclaimed team that guides renowned Pinot Noi
 r and Chardonnay producer Rhys Vineyards\, Centennial Mountain was establi
 shed to explore Italian grape varieties grown on its acclaimed Centennial 
 Mountain Vineyard in the rugged mountains of Northern Sonoma County.\n\nTh
 e Centennial Mountain Vineyard Tasting features the winery’s coveted Neb
 biolo\, and the pioneering Carricante and Nerello Mascalese wines\, among 
 others. To showcase how beautifully the wines pair with food\, the winery 
 also offers a delicious Wine and Sushi Pairing from nearby Asahi Sushi\, o
 ne of Healdsburg’s most popular dining destinations.\n\nGuests can also 
 enhance their tasting experience with a curated salumi board from Journeym
 an Meat Company. This generous accompaniment features six house-made salum
 i\, crostini\, cornichons\, olives\, and a selection of local cheese that 
 serves 2 to 5 guests.
LOCATION:Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
URL:https://cmvineyard.com/visit/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Olio Nuovo Harvest and Milling Experience at Gold Ridge Organic Fa
 rms
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T141500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T153000
UID:2610211d0s9aETpUeg579nPKnKig
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable behind-the-scenes journey into th
 e heart of our olive harvest season. This experience offers a rare opportu
 nity to see how our award-winning olive oil is crafted\, from the branches
  of our olive trees to the first drops of the season’s oil.\n\nYour jour
 ney begins with a guided tour of our 88-acre organic farm. You’ll step i
 nto the orchards to watch our expert team harvest fresh olives straight fr
 om the trees at their peak of flavor.\n\nNext\, you’ll visit our state-o
 f-the-art olive oil mill\, where you’ll learn about the milling process 
 and see the olives pressed into vibrant\, fresh Olio Nuovo\, the celebrate
 d “new oil” prized by culinary enthusiasts for its brilliant green hue
  and robust\, peppery finish.\n\nThe highlight comes right at the source: 
 tasting fresh Olio Nuovo straight from the mill just moments after the oli
 ves are crushed.\n\nBook now to secure your spot for this rare\, behind-th
 e-scenes look at our harvest traditions.\n\nImportant Notes: Please wear c
 omfortable shoes suitable for walking on a working farm This outdoor exper
 ience may be canceled due to wet weather. Full refund available.
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/gold-ridge-organic-farms/event/627571/olio
 -nuovo-harvest-and-milling-experience
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Touching the Earth: Dharma and Yoga
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T150000
UID:261012-iUCoH3-REWpuGv_9XZJSw
DESCRIPTION:with Djuna Devereaux and Rolf Gates\n\nWhen stress and uncerta
 inty arise\, returning to the body and our connection with the earth offer
 s stability\, calm\, and the possibility of a wise response. In this daylo
 ng retreat\, we’ll cultivate embodied presence as a taproot—grounding 
 us and settling the mind. From this refuge\, we’ll explore opening to cl
 arity\, joy\, and belonging.\n\nOur day will weave together Dharma teachin
 gs\, meditation\, somatic movement\, and yoga asana into a deeply nourishi
 ng experience. We’ll begin with floor-based movement to release tension 
 and fatigue\, then flow into accessible yoga sequences. Drawing on persona
 l stories and classical Buddhist teachings\, we’ll explore what it means
  to be grounded in the body\, held by awareness\, and supported by communi
 ty. All abilities and levels of experience warmly welcomed!
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/touching-the-earth-dha
 rma-and-yoga-dj3d26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Opera Film:  ŒDIPE\, Bregenz Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T154500
UID:260926hDuT6hWMMkewRMlPOLelpw
DESCRIPTION:It is George Enescu's only opera: the Romanian composer strugg
 led for years with the greatest of all tragedies\, the myth of Oedipus\, w
 ho kills his father and marries his mother because the gods have predestin
 ed it so. The new Bregenz production of the work is directed by the intern
 ationally renowned director Andreas Kriegenburg.\n\nBased on the ancient G
 reek myth and Sophocles' tragedies\, the opera follows King Laïos's curs
 ed fate\, Œdipe unknowingly fulfilling the prophecy to kill his father 
 and marry his mother\, and his eventual redemption after decades of isolat
 ion.
LOCATION:Jarvis Conservatory
URL:https://jarvisconservatory.ticketspice.com/oedipe
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
