BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Country Line Dancing Night ft. Dustin Saylor & The Stowaways
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T190000
UID:261022Mjze3wbdZ0OA9iAO0MkEmg
DESCRIPTION:Date: Saturday\, November 28\, 2026\n\nTime: Doors 6 PM | Les
 sons 7-8 PM | Live music throughout the night\n\nTickets: $20 Advance | $2
 5 Door | Coyote Sonoma Members Receive $5 Off\n\nJoin us for line dancing 
 lessons from Grapevine Dance! Plus live music from Dustin Saylor & The Sto
 waways.\n\nAbout Dustin Saylor:\n\nDustin Saylor\, a Northern California-b
 orn country singer-songwriter\, has made a name for himself as the \\#1 Co
 untry/Folk artist in the San Francisco Bay Area. His musical journey began
  in childhood\, first at the piano and later as a guitarist and singer for
  his high school youth group and local church. Despite early challenges\, 
 including a devastating American Idol rejection in 2009\, Saylor had a tra
 nsformative moment on his long drive home\, realizing that true success re
 quired full commitment. Embracing his calling\, he quit bartending\, pursu
 ed a music degree at Sonoma State University\, and became a full-time musi
 cian. Over the years\, he has performed alongside artists like Tyler Rich\
 , Chase Rice\, and Daughtry\, with his sound often compared to Thomas Rhet
 t and Chris Stapleton. His songwriting is deeply personal\, shaped by his 
 early experiences of adoption and the contrasting struggles and joys of hi
 s life. Through his music\, Saylor seeks to inspire\, heal\, and create a 
 space where people can connect beyond labels. Committed to his craft\, he 
 remains "all in\," determined to sing and play music for the rest of his l
 ife.
LOCATION:Coyote Sonoma
URL:https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/country-line-dancing-with-dustin-saylor-
 -the-stowaways-1128-p270.aspx
