UID:260206Rs2UY7xylU2rXkbTBcUf0g
DESCRIPTION:*Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come 
 together.*\n\nJoin us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a ta
 sting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from acr
 oss the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll 
 and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new so
 unds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\n**Mimi & Gabe** Mimi & Gabe aka
  “Le Duo” brings a fun\, eclectic mix of classic hits\, soulful ballad
 s\, and vibrant originals\, delivered with rich harmonies and a playful ac
 oustic style. \n\n**Details**\n\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but thi
 s event tends to fill up quickly\, so we recommend making a reservation. W
 e are dog and family friendly!
