DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T110000
UID:261026e-ueHv25qk-Zoyt9JAx-tQ
DESCRIPTION:Body Sculpt | Strength & Movement\n\nA movement-based strength
  training class designed to build functional strength\, sculpt and tone mu
 scles\, and deepen your mind-body connection. With an emphasis on core sta
 bility\, lower-body strength\, balance\, and mobility\, this class support
 s dancers and anyone looking to feel stronger and more connected to their 
 body.\n\nAll levels and body types welcome! Modifications are available\, 
 and no dance experience is necessary.\n\nBring your own resistance bands o
 r light dumbbells if you have them. No equipment required!\n\nDATE: Sunday
  10:00 am\n\nAdress: 4140 Redwood Hwy 8\, San Rafael\n\nTeacher: Abigail C
 elestino
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
