DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T170000
UID:260728Z8cjkbFGgkybHcTYf8OGrg
DESCRIPTION:Pianist Larry Vuchovich with Special Guest Star Vocalist Jacki
 e Ryan\n\nLarry Vuckovich is a Yugoslavian-born American jazz pianist accl
 aimed for his eclectic style blending bop\, post-bop\, blues\, and world m
 usic. Classically trained in Kotor\, he emigrated to San Francisco in 1951
 \, studied with Vince Guaraldi\, and performed with legends like Mel Torm
 é\, Jon Hendricks\, Philly Joe Jones\, and Dexter Gordon. A fixture at to
 p US and European jazz venues\, he leads ensembles such as Blue Balkan and
  has been honored with multiple lifetime achievement awards.
LOCATION:Sebastiani Theatre
URL:http://www.sonomavalleyjazzsociety.org
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Overeaters Anonymous (OA) Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T103000
UID:260728URVDMC-_xUC39EeP6bmxEA
DESCRIPTION:Is Food a Problem for You? You Are Not Alone.\n\nIn OA\, membe
 rs experience spiritual\, emotional\, and physical recovery by practicing 
 the Twelve Steps and living by their spiritual principles—one day at a t
 ime.\n\nOvereaters Anonymous (OA) is a fellowship of people who support ea
 ch other in recovering from compulsive eating and food behaviors. If you f
 eel you have a problem with food\, OA welcomes you—no matter what your b
 ackground\, beliefs\, or eating habits. \n\nWe hold an in-person meetings
  at 9:30 on Sunday mornings at Church of the Nazarene\, 18980 Arnold Drive
 \, Sonoma\, CA (a small room directly off of parking lot\; look for the si
 gn posted) and newcomers are always welcome.\n\nYou may view all North Bay
  OA in-person and online meetings at https://www.northbayoa.org/meetings.h
 tml\n\nOA is not a diet club or calorie-counting program.\n\nMembers have 
 different plans of eating.\n\nOA does not endorse any specific food plan.
  \n\nVisit: https://www.northbayoa.org/\n\nFind a meeting: https://www.no
 rthbayoa.org/meetings.html
LOCATION:Church of the Nazarene  (a small room directly off of parking lot
 \; look for the sign posted)
URL:https://www.northbayoa.org/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
