DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261201T000000
UID:260504MQOtYqIodkuYYdH3qKswMw
DESCRIPTION:A fun community bike ride through the heart of Santa Rosa. Com
 e join us this Tuesday! We roll through the JC and McDonald Ave neighborho
 od\, stop in Courthouse Square\, then on to the taco trucks at Mitote Food
  Park in Roseland for dinner! We depart Mitote at 8:15pm\, ride back throu
 gh Courthouse Square\, then on to Yogurt Farms for dessert. This ride is 8
  miles round trip and rides all year long. Rides canceled for rain and hol
 idays. All riders welcome. Bring the whole family! Meet at SRJC parking lo
 t at 550 Silva Ave. We are renting the use of this parking lot every Tuesd
 ay from 5:30pm to 9:30 pm. Taco Tuesday riders can park in the lot during 
 that time frame for free. Please park cars along the back wall on the east
  side. And stage in the row on the northern side of the lot \\(closest to 
 Silva Ave\\). Meet at 5:30pm\; pedals up at 6pm.
LOCATION:SRJC Parking Lot
URL:https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/#jlupcoming-events
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Beginner Salsa – Tuesdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261201T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261201T190000
UID:260705YYJ4SAovak6J8NAtELEIDQ
DESCRIPTION:Ready to dance? Join our beginner salsa class where no experie
 nce or partner is needed. Just comfortable shoes and desire to have fun!\n
 \nGreat for first timers!\n\nNo dance experience required\n\nNon-marking s
 hoes soles\n\nNo partner necessary\n\nOur relaxed environment is perfect f
 or learning salsa basics\, as we make it fun and enjoyable. In this class 
 you will learn basic directional steps\, proper frame for partner-work and
  simple turn patterns. We organize our curriculum so that the movements ar
 e easy to remember. Join us to learn the fundamentals! No experience is ne
 cessary and no partner is required. Drop-in fee is $20.\n\nTuesdays @ 6:00
 pm – 7:00pm\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highway #8 San Rafael\, CA\n\nNote:
  Arrive 10 minutes before. No floor marking shoe soles allowed.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/salsa-beginners-tuesdays/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Intermediate Salsa Class
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261201T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261201T200000
UID:260704LQUKr4tdiUq3c-LjFkyM3A
DESCRIPTION:This class is designed for dancers who have a solid grasp of t
 he basics and are eager to expand their repertoire with more complex and f
 luid movements.\n\n**Pre- requisite:**\n\nSalsa Class Beginners\n\nEach we
 ek\, we’ll break down a new move\, focusing on the technique and connect
 ion that will make you a more confident and stylish dancer. We’ll go bey
 ond the foundational steps to cover a wide range of essential intermediate
  patterns and styling\, including:\n\n**Turns and Spins:**\n\nMaster your 
 inside and outside turns\, double spins\, and the elegant 360 and Hand Tos
 s moves.\n\n**Intricate Patterns:**\n\nLearn to execute the 360\, wrap\, a
 s well as various Cross Body Lead variations like the U-Turn and Spiral.\n
 \n**Footwork and Styling:**\n\nEnhance your rhythm and flair with advanced
  footwork like the Suzy Q\, Front Tap\, and Mambo Step. We’ll also work 
 on styling with a wrap and improving your posture and upper body movement.
 \n\nThis class is your chance to refine your technique\, improve your lead
 -follow connection\, and add a variety of fun and dynamic moves to your sa
 lsa vocabulary. Join us and elevate your dance!\n\n**Details:**\n\nNo part
 ner necessary — rotations ensure everyone gets to dance.\n\nPlease wear
  **non-marking shoe soles** to protect the floor.\n\nArrive 10 minutes e
 arly to warm up and get settled.\n\nDate & Time: Tuesdays @ 7:00 pm – 8:
 00 PM
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/salsa-class-intermediate-tuesday/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
